Type a word containing a non-breaking space (U+00A0), then erase by word (^W).
The word scan in ctlw lands on the 0xA0 rune, exercising the high-control branch
of alnum (0x7F<=c<=0xA0).

-- input --
type a b
key ctrl-w
-- waitframes --
29 33 37 41 45
-- drawops --
JIqbbAbddbbbbdbbbbdbbbYbilbbd{5}bbd{30}lddxddlddxddlddxd{10}
